+// Vulkan PS2 VRAM mirror (Phase 3 step 2), #included by gs_vk_backend.cpp inside its anonymous namespace.
+// 4 MB device-local buffer = GS local memory. Host->local uploads are swizzled on the GPU by gs_vk_swizzle.comp;
